package com.example.ui.localization

/** Machine draft; review pending. */
internal object WorldSoDraft26 {
    val MAP: Map<String, String> = mapOf(
        "Stand silently and listen to the imam. Do not recite al-Fatihah or a surah, whether he recites aloud or quietly." to "Istaag oo dhegayso imaamka. Faatixa ama suurad ha akhrin, ha akhriyo ama kor u akhriyo.",
        "When the imam finishes al-Fatihah aloud, say Ameen quietly." to "Marka imaamku kor u dhameeyo al-Fatixah, aamus Amiin dheh.",
        "Recite Surah al-Fatihah, say Ameen quietly, then recite a surah or at least three short verses." to "Akhri suuradda al-Faatixah, si aamusan u dheh Ameen, kadibna akhri suurad ama ugu yaraan saddex aayadood oo gaagaaban.",
        "Any surah you know may be recited. Keep the order of the Quran: the surah of the second rak‘ah should come after that of the first." to "Suurad kasta oo aad taqaan waa la akhrin karaa. Ilaali nidaamka Quraanka: suuradda rakcada labaad waa inay timaadaa ka dib tii hore.",
        "Recite Bismillah, Surah al-Fatihah and another surah, as in the first rak‘ah." to "Akhri Bismillah, Suuradda Al-Faatixah iyo suurad kale, sida rakcadii hore.",
        "In Sunnah, Nafl and Witr a surah is added after al-Fatihah in every rak‘ah." to "Sunnada, Nafil iyo Witr-ka waxa lagu daray suurad al-Faatixa ka dib rakca kasta.",
        "Recite Bismillah and Surah al-Fatihah only. No surah is added in the third and fourth rak‘at of a Fard prayer." to "Akhri bismillah iyo suuratu al-Faatixa oo kaliya. Suurad laguma darin rakcada saddexaad iyo afaraad ee salaadda Fard.",
        "Dua-e-Qunut" to "Dua-e-Qunut",
        "After the surah of the third rak‘ah, raise the hands {hands} saying Allahu Akbar, fold them again and recite Dua-e-Qunut quietly. Then go into ruku‘." to "Ka dib suurada rakcada saddexaad, gacmaha kor u taag {hands} adoo leh Allahu Akbar, marlabaad laabi oo si aamusan u akhri Dua-e-Qunut. Markaas gal ruku’u.",
        "If you have not memorised it yet, recite ‘Rabbana atina…’ or say ‘Allahummaghfir li’ three times, and keep learning it." to "Haddaadan weli xafidin, akhri ‘Rabbana atina…’ ama saddex jeer dheh ‘Allahummaghfir li’, oo sii wad barashada.",
        "Ruku‘" to "Ruku'",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and bow. Grip the knees with the fingers spread, keep the back level and the head in line with it. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Allaahu Akbar dheh oo rukuuca. Qabo jilbaha iyadoo faraha ay fidsan yihiin, ku hay heerka dhabarka iyo madaxa inuu la siman yahay. Akhri tasbiixda ugu yaraan saddex jeer.",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and bow only as far as the hands reach the knees. Rest the hands on the knees with the fingers together, keep the arms close to the body and do not straighten the back fully. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Allaahu Akbar dheh oo sujuuda inta ay gacmuhu ka gaarayaan jilbaha. Gacmaha ku naso jilbaha adoo faraha iskula jira, gacmaha ku hay meel u dhow jirka hana toosin dhabarka si buuxda. Akhri tasbiixda ugu yaraan saddex jeer.",
        "Qawmah (standing up)" to "Qawmah (soo istaagtay)",
        "Rise saying Sami‘allahu liman hamidah, stand fully upright with the arms at the sides, and say Rabbana wa lakal-hamd." to "Kac adigoo leh Sami‘allaahu Liman xamidah, si qumman u istaag, gacmahana dhinacyada, oo dheh Rabbana wa lakal-xamd.",
        "When the imam says Sami‘allahu liman hamidah, rise, stand fully upright and say only Rabbana wa lakal-hamd." to "Markuu imaamku dhaho Sami‘allaahu liman xamidah, kac, si qumman u istaag oo dheh Rabbana wa lakal-xamd kaliya.",
        "Pause until every joint has settled before going down." to "Jooji ilaa kala-goysyadu ay degayaan ka hor intaadan hoos u dhicin.",
        "Two sajdahs" to "Laba sacadood",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and go down: knees first, then hands, then nose and forehead between the hands. Keep the elbows raised, the arms away from the sides, the belly away from the thighs, and the toes pressed towards the Qibla. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Allaahu Akbar dheh oo hoos u dhaadhac: marka hore jilbaha, ka dibna gacmaha, ka dibna sanka iyo foodda gacmaha dhexdooda. Suxullada kor u qaad, gacmahana dhinacyada ka fogee, calooshana bowdada ka fogee, suulashana ku cadaadi dhanka Qiblada. Akhri tasbiixda ugu yaraan saddex jeer.",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and go down into sajdah drawn together: the arms resting on the ground close to the sides, the belly on the thighs and both feet turned out to the right. Recite the tasbih at least three times." to "Allaahu Akbar dheh oo u dhaadhac sajdah oo la wada sawiray: gacmaha oo dhulka ku taagan oo dhinacyada u dhow, caloosha bowdada iyo labada cagood ayaa u leexday dhanka midig. Akhri tasbiixda ugu yaraan saddex jeer.",
        "Rise with Allahu Akbar and sit upright for a moment (Jalsa). You may say Rabbighfir li." to "Allahu Akbar la kac oo fadhiiso wax yar (Jalsa). Waxaad odhan kartaa Rabbighfir li.",
        "Say Allahu Akbar and make the second sajdah in the same way." to "Allaahu akbar dheh, sajadda labaadna sidaas oo kale u samee.",
        "After the second sajdah say Allahu Akbar and remain seated." to "Sajdah labaad ka dib dheh Allahu Akbar oo fadhiiso.",
        "Then stand up for the next rak‘ah saying Allahu Akbar, without sitting or leaning on the ground." to "Ka dib u istaag rakcada xigta adigoo leh Allahu Akbar, adoon fadhiyin, dhulkana ku tiirsanayn.",
        "First sitting (Qa‘dah Ula)" to "Fadhiga ugu horreeya (Qa'dah Ula)",
        "Recite only the Tashahhud." to "Kaliya akhri Tashahhud.",
        "Then stand for the third rak‘ah saying Allahu Akbar." to "Ka dib u istaag rakcada saddexaad oo leh Allahu Akbar.",
        "In four rak‘at of Sunnah Ghair-Muakkadah or Nafl, also recite Durood and dua here and begin the third rak‘ah with Thana. In Sunnah Muakkadah recite only the Tashahhud." to "Afarta rakcadood ee Sunnah Ghair-Muakkadah ama Nafil, sidoo kale halkan ku akhri Durood iyo ducada oo ku billow rakcada saddexaad Thana. Sunnaha Muakkadah akhri Tashahhud kaliya.",
        "Final sitting (Qa‘dah Akhirah)" to "Fadhiga u dambeeya (Qa'dah Akhirah)",
        "Recite the Tashahhud, then Durood-e-Ibrahim, then a dua." to "Akhri Tashaxud, ka dibna Durood-i-Ibraahim, ka dibna ducada.",
        "Either of the two duas shown is enough." to "Labada duco ee la tusay midkood ayaa ku filan.",
        "Salam" to "Salaam",
        "Turn the face to the right and say As-salamu ‘alaykum wa rahmatullah, then to the left and say it again. The prayer is complete." to "Midig u leexi wejiga oo dheh As-salaamu calaykum wa raxmatullah, dabadeed bidixda u jeedi oo mar kale ku dheh. Salaaddu waa dhammaatay.",
        "Give each salam just after the imam, never before him." to "Sii salaan kasta ka dib imaamka, waligaa isaga ka hor.",
        "After the salam" to "Salaan ka dib",
        "Say Astaghfirullah three times, recite Ayat al-Kursi and the Tasbih of Fatimah, then raise your hands and make dua." to "Astaghfirullah saddex jeer dheh, akhri Aayat al-Kursi iyo Tasbiixda Faaduma, dabadeed gacmaha kor u taag oo ducada.",
        "After a Fard that is followed by Sunnah (Zuhr, Maghrib, Isha), make a short dua, pray the Sunnah, and recite these afterwards." to "Fardo ay raacdo sunnaha ka bacdi (Zuhr, Maghrib, Isha), ducada gaaban, tukada sunnada, kadibna akhri kuwan.",
        "Conditions of Salah" to "Xaaladaha Salah",
        "Six things that must be in place before the prayer" to "Lix shay oo ay waajib tahay inay meesha ku jiraan ka hor salaadda",
        "Taharah: the body, the clothes and the place of prayer are clean, and you are in wudu, or have made ghusl where it is due." to "Taharah: Jirka, Dharka iyo Goobta lagu Tukado waa Nadiif, waxaadna ku Sugan tahay Wudu, ama waxaad ku Noolaysay Meeshii ay Mudnayd.",
        "Satr-e-awrah: a man covers from the navel to below the knees; a woman covers her whole body except the face, the hands and the feet." to "Satr-e-awrah: ninku wuxuu daboolaa min xudunta ilaa jilbaha hoostiisa; naagtu waxay dabooshaa jirkeeda oo dhan marka laga reebo wejiga, gacmaha iyo cagaha.",
        "Istiqbal-e-Qibla: facing the Ka‘bah." to "Istiqbal-e-Qibla: oo u jeeda Kacbada.",
        "Waqt: the time of that prayer has entered." to "Waaqt: waxaa la galay waqtigii salaaddaas.",
        "Niyyah: a firm intention in the heart for that particular prayer." to "Niyyah: ujeedo adag oo qalbiga ka jirta ducadaas gaarka ah.",
        "Takbir-e-Tahrimah: beginning the prayer with Allahu Akbar." to "Takbir-e-Taxrimah: ku bilow salaadda Allaahu Akbar.",
        "Fard acts of Salah" to "Falalka Fard ee Saalax",
        "Seven pillars inside the prayer" to "Todoba tiir oo salaadda dhexdeeda ah",
        "Takbir-e-Tahrimah." to "Takbir-e-Taxrimah.",
        "Qiyam: standing, for one who is able, in Fard and Wajib prayers." to "Qiyaam: u taagan, qofkii awooda, salaadda Fard iyo Waajib.",
        "Qira’at: reciting the Quran while standing." to "Qira'at: akhrinta quraanka adigoo taagan.",
        "Ruku‘." to "Ruku'.",
        "Sujud: two sajdahs in every rak‘ah." to "Sujuud: laba sajdah rakco kasta.",
        "Qa‘dah Akhirah: sitting at the end for the length of the Tashahhud." to "Qa'dah Akhirah: fadhida dhamaadka dhererka Tashahhud.",
        "Khuruj bi-sun‘ihi: leaving the prayer by an act of your own, such as the salam." to "Khuruj bi-sun‘ihi: uga tag salaadda camal adiga kuu gaar ah, sida salaam.",
        "A missed Fard cannot be repaired by Sajdah Sahw; the prayer must be prayed again." to "Fard seegtay ma hagaajin karto Sajdah Sahw; ducada waa in markale la tukadaa.",
        "Wajib acts of Salah" to "Waajib falkii Saalax",
        "The necessary acts that complete the pillars" to "Falalka lagama maarmaanka ah ee dhamaystiraya tiirarka",
        "Beginning the prayer with the words Allahu Akbar." to "Isagoo ku bilaabaya salaadda kelmadda Allaahu Akbar.",
        "Reciting Surah al-Fatihah, and adding a surah or three short verses in the first two rak‘at of Fard and in every rak‘ah of Witr, Sunnah and Nafl." to "In la akhriyo suuradda al-Faatixa, oo lagu daro suurad ama saddex aayadood oo gaagaaban labada rakcadood ee ugu horreeya Fardka iyo rakca kasta oo Witr, Sunna iyo Naaf ah.",
        "Reciting al-Fatihah before the surah." to "Faatixada oo la akhriyo suuradda ka hor.",
        "Qawmah, standing upright after ruku‘, and Jalsa, sitting upright between the two sajdahs." to "Qawmah, oo taagan rukuuc dabadii, iyo Jalsa, oo fadhiya labada sajadood dhexdooda.",
        "Ta‘dil-e-arkan: staying still in ruku‘, qawmah, sajdah and jalsa for at least one ‘Subhanallah’." to "Ta’dil-e-arkan: ku joogista ruku’, qawmah, sajdah iyo jalsa ugu yaraan hal ‘Subhanallah’.",
        "Qa‘dah Ula, the first sitting in a three- or four-rak‘at prayer, and reciting the full Tashahhud in both sittings." to "Qa'dah Ula, oo ah qofka ugu horreeya ee ku fadhiya salaad saddex ama afar-rakcadood ah, oo akhriya Tashahhud buuxda labada fadhiba.",
        "Adding nothing after the Tashahhud in the first sitting of Fard, Witr and Sunnah Muakkadah." to "In aan waxba lagu darin ka dib Tashahhud fadhigii ugu horreeyay ee Fard, Witr iyo Sunnah Muakkadah.",
        "Ending the prayer with the word ‘As-salam’ twice." to "Ku dhammaynta salaadda kelmadda ‘As-salaam’ laba jeer.",
        "Dua-e-Qunut in Witr, and the takbir before it." to "Dua-e-Qunut ee Witr, iyo takbiirta ka hor.",
        "The six extra takbirs of the two Eid prayers." to "Lixda takbiir ee dheeraadka ah ee labada salaadood ee ciida.",
        "The imam reciting aloud in Fajr, Maghrib, Isha, Jumu‘ah and Eid, and quietly in Zuhr and Asr." to "Imaamku isagoo kor u akhrinaya Fajr, Maghrib, Cisha, Jumuca iyo Ciidda, isagoo aamusanna ku akhrinaya Zuxar iyo Casar.",
        "The follower staying silent while the imam recites, and following the imam in every act." to "Dabadeeto oo iska aamusa inta imaamku akhrinayo, oo daba gal imaamka camal kasta.",
        "Keeping every Fard and Wajib in its place, without delaying or repeating it." to "Fard kasta iyo Waajib kasta oo meesheeda lagu hayo, iyadoo aan dib loo dhigin, laguna celinayn.",
    )
}
